; Send this station's card to another station over the air.
FORM CARD_SEND
TITLE Send your card
SUMMARY Sends your station card to another station, so it can read your fingerprint back to you and seal frequencies and keys to you.
LEVEL ZERO
ORDER 20
ACTION card_send
FIELD to Send to(X) required upper max=16 check=station
NEXT CARD_CHECK
BEGIN_HELP
Send to:
The call of the station that should hold your card: your net control or keymaster.
Then read your fingerprint to them by voice, or in person.
END
